<title>CHINA: IBK launches US$50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>IBK launches US$50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger Sanwa International Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER    INDUSTRIAL BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$50 MLN  COUPON     3ML+25BP  MATURITY   3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 RE-OFFER   --</p>
<p> PUTS	  ANNUAL     CALLS	ANNUAL    LAUNCH    28.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING     --	   REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   28.JUL.97</p>
<p> RATING	A1 *	 SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS    US$1 MLN</p>
<p> GOV LAW     ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  S.KOREA</p>
<p> PAY DATE    05.AUG.97 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p> FEES	  2.0BP FOR CO-LEAD MANAGERS COMMITTING US$10 MLN</p>
<p> ARRANGER    SANWA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> NOTES	 * ISSUER RATING</p>
<p>		 THE NOTES ARE ISSUED UNDER THE BANK'S US$1.0 BLN</p>
<p>		 GLOBAL MEDIUM-TERM NOTE PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
